# ==============================================================================
# Telegram Bot Notification Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather on Telegram to get your TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
# 2. Start a chat with your bot and send any message
# 3. Get your numeric chat ID from @userinfobot or https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates
# 4. Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
# ==============================================================================

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id_here
